<title>UK: UK reserves rise underlying $1.00 mln in January.</title>
<headline>UK reserves rise underlying $1.00 mln in January.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's gold and currency reserves rose an underlying $1.00 million in January the Treasury said. (IN MLN DOLLARS EXCEPT WHERE STATED)</p>
<p>					 JANUARY		DECEMBER</p>
<p> Underlying reserves	     + ONE		   - 109</p>
